1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,700
Groundstate is Git for the Physical World.
Versioned state, backed by evidence.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,750
The live product starts clean.
Capture one observation for a project.

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:13,750
Projects keep physical contexts separate.
Evidence and next actions stay together.

4
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:18,750
Photo or operator note in.
A typed claim and its provenance out.

5
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:23,750
Demo replay states the mission clearly: observe, clarify, correct, then wake.
It is isolated from live project state.

6
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:29,750
The semantic diff shows what changed.
Ambiguity becomes a human decision.

7
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:35,750
Corrections travel through dependent assumptions.
History stays inspectable.

8
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:41,750
Expected transitions can wake the agent.
Gemini + Firestore + Pub/Sub keep continuity.

9
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,750
Groundstate remembers how reality changed.
